# Logging must be configured BEFORE the application context exists, so AutoConfiguration.imports is too late for
# these two: the post-processor sets Boot's structured-logging defaults, and Boot loads the masking customizer from
# here alongside any customizer a service names in logging.structured.json.customizer (D141).
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
ae.gov.dubaicustoms.platform.logging.autoconfigure.PlatformLoggingEnvironmentPostProcessor
org.springframework.boot.logging.structured.StructuredLoggingJsonMembersCustomizer=\
ae.gov.dubaicustoms.platform.logging.autoconfigure.internal.PlatformLogMasking
